  "review_limits": [
    "One declared bounded A_RG2b quartic/profile/source/allocation and frozen joint completion; no generic all-A_RG2b or arbitrary-graph theorem.",
    "The full 30-dimensional continuous domain covers fourteen charge-tangent resource and sixteen conductance directions. No future trajectory after 302 is required; floating proposals only supply exact rational coefficients.",
    "The unique section is Lipschitz in the joint C/W state. No derivative or C1 regularity of Gamma is assumed; both physical H consumers, the full conductance writer and section difference correction are included. Physical states are never clipped.",
    "Uniform duration is 16 and elapsed target time to completion is 4832. Duration 32 remains uncertified; a failed available bound is not a universal impossibility result.",
    "Thirteen fresh scientific/surface tests and two complete same-implementation prefix replays passed. No independent external reviewer is claimed.",
    "Earlier proposals retain compact history, original hashes and exact generators. Superseded full trajectories are absent and are not claimed to have been freshly rechecked.",
    "Current earns one local child; reset and read-only replay earn zero live gain. Native completion, hierarchy, aggregate P9-10.5/10.6 and G4 remain separate.",
    "SC-1 and all nine earlier accepted families are unchanged. The A_OS below-100 investigation remains paused.",
    "The broader repository audit retains pre-existing source drift at specs/README.md."
  ],
